    <itunes:duration>00:53:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYj0hMI04zot0WT-kzguAbC7zdH.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.29 米兰冬奥会雪场长啥样？在阿尔卑斯山感受冰雪世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698c2daea22480add6abcce4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698c2daea22480add6abcce4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，欢迎来到周末同频，这是一档南方周末App出品的播客栏目。为你讲述和解读热点新闻，与你分享南周报道背后的故事。</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span>【本期内容】</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>北京时间 2026年2月7日凌晨，第25届冬奥会在意大利米兰开幕了。本届冬奥会由米兰和科尔蒂纳丹佩佐这两座城市共同承办，其中科尔蒂纳丹佩佐是意大利北部贝卢诺省的城市。坐落在阿尔卑斯山脉的南麓，被誉为多洛米蒂山脉的皇后，以顶级滑雪场和阿尔卑斯的风光闻名。本期节目我们邀请到了南方周末地理版作者、婚礼摄影师沉白白，米兰冬奥开幕前的几天，她就在本届冬奥的举办地科尔蒂纳滑雪度假，让她来和我们聊聊关于米兰冬奥会的有趣故事。</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>沉白白：生活在欧洲的婚礼摄影师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听提示】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">00:03:15</a> &nbsp;冬奥举办前的意大利小城科尔蒂纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">00:07:23</a> &nbsp;中东的富豪会把自家游艇停在威尼斯，然后开着超级跑车去科尔蒂纳滑雪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">00:14:23</a> &nbsp;奥运项目的雪场赛道是什么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">00:16:57</a> &nbsp;在阿尔卑斯山滑一次雪能去到三四个国家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">00:31:32</a> &nbsp;除了海滩美景，意大利也有冬日风光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">00:36:43</a> &nbsp;夏天的阿尔卑斯山是徒步胜地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">00:44:49</a> &nbsp;在阿尔卑斯山滑雪人均“酒驾”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3647">01:00:47</a> &nbsp;残疾人也能参加滑雪项目？冬残奥会也有看点</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span>【相关报道】</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><a href="http://www.infzm.com/content/314697http://www.infzm.com/content/314697?from=nfzmwx" data-url="http://www.infzm.com/content/314697http://www.infzm.com/content/314697?from=nfzmwx"><span>科尔蒂纳：多洛米蒂的“多面女王”</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.infzm.com/content/224303http://www.infzm.com/content/314697?from=nfzmwx" data-url="http://www.infzm.com/content/224303http://www.infzm.com/content/314697?from=nfzmwx"><span>2026，告诉你一个真实的科尔蒂纳&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><img alt="科尔蒂纳全景  摄影 沉白白" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXMuaW5mem0uY29tL2Ntcy9tZWRpYXMvaW1hZ2UvMjYvMDIvMTAvZmI4ZWJiZjFiNC5qcGc="></p><span></span><blockquote><span>科尔蒂纳全景 &nbsp;摄影 沉白白</span></blockquote><span></span><p><img alt="2026冬奥会前夕的科尔蒂纳小镇  摄影 沉白白" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXMuaW5mem0uY29tL2Ntcy9tZWRpYXMvaW1hZ2UvMjYvMDIvMTAvMTAxYzhhODhjNS5qcGc="></p><span></span><blockquote><span>2026冬奥会前夕的科尔蒂纳小镇 &nbsp;摄影 沉白白</span></blockquote><span></span><p><img alt="水晶山顶的初级雪道  摄影 沉白白" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXMuaW5mem0uY29tL2Ntcy9tZWRpYXMvaW1hZ2UvMjYvMDIvMTAvNDlkMTM1MGJiOS5qcGc="></p><span></span><blockquote><span>水晶山顶的初级雪道 &nbsp;摄影 沉白白</span></blockquote><span></span><p><img alt="山屋（Rifugio）是登山者与滑雪者休息用餐的设施。  摄影 沉白白" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXMuaW5mem0uY29tL2Ntcy9tZWRpYXMvaW1hZ2UvMjYvMDIvMTAvYjFkMWQxNjgwMi5qcGc="></p><span></span><blockquote><span>山屋（Rifugio）是登山者与滑雪者休息用餐的设施。 &nbsp;摄影 沉白白</span></blockquote><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXMuaW5mem0uY29tL2Ntcy9tZWRpYXMvaW1hZ2UvMjYvMDIvMTAvMGFmZDNiMTUzOC5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><span>雪场里一个调酒品牌的广告。摄影 沉白白</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【出品团队】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>主播/卡卡</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>音频剪辑/李赫 小尘</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>运营推广/李赫 李睿妍</span></blockquote><span></span><h4><br></h4><span></span><h4><strong><span>【反馈与建议】</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>如你对本期节目有任何感想，或者对“周末同频”栏目和未来几期的节目主题有任何建议，欢迎扫描下方二维码，添加南周小助手微信进行反馈，或者直接通过“写评论”的方式提出。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZXMuaW5mem0uY29tL2Ntcy9tZWRpYXMvaW1hZ2UvMjQvMDYvMjcvMmFlYmZkMjY3Zi5wbmc="></p>]]></description>
