  <item>
    <title>Vol.24 AI时代，人文社科专业还值得报考吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6867856760f8f77d40d13d0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6867856760f8f77d40d13d0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年高考报考进行时，在人工智能浪潮下，人文社科的价值何在？人文社科专业还值得报考吗？法学专业的就业前景如何？南方周末高考之后有“高招”系列特邀南开大学法学院副院长陈兵，从高考志愿填报讲起，和我们一起解锁“AI时代通关密码”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【特邀嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>南开大学法学院副院长 陈兵</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听提示】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> &nbsp;普通家庭出身的孩子可以学法学吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> &nbsp;南开大学法学院介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> &nbsp;南开大学经管法实验班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2146">35:46</a> &nbsp;南开大学法学院如何加强对学生的实践培养？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> &nbsp;南开大学的因材施教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> &nbsp;英语对法学专业的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a> &nbsp;哪些学生适合学习法学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> &nbsp;人工智能的出现，给法学带来了哪些机遇or挑战?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4921">01:22:01</a> &nbsp;文科生学习法学会比理科生更有优势吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;AI时代去读文科还是一个好的选择吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【延伸阅读】</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.infzm.com/contents/296586?from=xyz" data-url="https://www.infzm.com/contents/296586?from=xyz"><span>高考之后有“高招”</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTe6TkDA45kGe-6OhMIaTV-vIpE.png"></figure>]]></description>
