  <item>
    <title>Vol.23 现在出国留学，还值得吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6866563e60f8f77d40ab837c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6866563e60f8f77d40ab837c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 10:22:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>现在出国留学，还值得吗？海外留学选校应优先考虑哪些因素？南方周末高考之后有“高招”系列特邀广东外语外贸大学国际学院院长刘田苗，聊一聊海外留学那些事儿。这期节目可能是你离“理性留学”最近的一次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【特邀嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>广东外语外贸大学国际学院院长 刘田苗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听提示】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> &nbsp;申请海外留学的步骤？高考分数可以申请海外哪些学校？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> &nbsp;中国留学生都爱去哪里留学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> &nbsp;留学以学校排名为重还是以专业排名为重？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> &nbsp;优先喜欢的专业还是优先就业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> &nbsp;文社科vs理工类，哪个选择更多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> &nbsp;就业倾向vs兴趣倾向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> &nbsp;本科留学vs硕士留学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> &nbsp;DIY 申请留学vs中介申请留学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3527">58:47</a> &nbsp;毕业后选择回国的留学生发展现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4075">01:07:55</a> 留学投入产出比</span></p><span></span><p><span>【延伸阅读】</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.infzm.com/contents/296586?from=xyz" data-url="https://www.infzm.com/contents/296586?from=xyz"><span>高考之后有“高招”</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTe6TkDA45kGe-6OhMIaTV-vIpE.png"></figure>]]></description>
